---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Alldrit Technologies"
  description="Meet the small Toronto software studio behind Alldrit Technologies."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Our studio"
    title="Software,<br /><em>simplified.</em>"
    description="Independent by design, curious by nature, and focused on making useful things exceptionally well."
    image="/images/stars/stars5.jpeg"
  />
  <section class="section" id="content">
    <div class="shell story-grid">
      <div class="story-sticky" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Built to build</span>
        <h2>Big thinking without the big-agency drag.</h2>
        <p>
          Alldrit Technologies is a Toronto-based studio led by engineer and founder Devin Alldrit.
          You work directly with the person designing the system and writing the code.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-blocks">
        <article class="story-block" data-reveal>
          <span>01 / EXPERIENCE</span><h3>Founder perspective</h3><p>
            Devin previously co-founded and served as CTO of Afino, a technology startup acquired in
            2022. That means product decisions are shaped by what actually happens after launch.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="story-block" data-reveal>
          <span>02 / APPROACH</span><h3>Clarity over complexity</h3><p>
            Great software should make the hard parts feel simple. We work in tight loops,
            communicate plainly, and build only what earns its place.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="story-block" data-reveal>
          <span>03 / RANGE</span><h3>From concept to production</h3><p>
            Consumer apps, business systems, interactive worlds, and useful automations—we bring the
            same care to the first prototype and the final polish.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="shell metrics" data-reveal>
      <div class="metric"><strong>15+</strong><span>products and projects launched</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>01</strong><span>senior point of contact</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>∞</strong><span>curiosity for hard problems</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell cta-panel" data-reveal>
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Free consultation</span><h2>Let’s make the first move.</h2></div><a
        class="button"
        href="mailto:info@alldrit.ca">Start a conversation ↗</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
